meilleurs ou un des pires vers

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'oreille de l'histoire de

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:19.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la musique :

00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:21.021 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:22.222 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La Macarena.

00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:23.457 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MIKE GAUTHIER,

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:24.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
animateur et journaliste musical

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.892 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- T'sais, ce qu'on appelle

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:27.127 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un one hit wonder, un feu

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:28.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de paille, un succès sans

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:29.329 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lendemain, qui réussit à être

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:30.530 size:53% position:73% line:53%
